        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "html": "Cuando es <strong>neutro</strong>, termina en <span class=\"gu\">-ું</span>:<br><span class=\"gu\">મારું</span> = mío, <span class=\"gu\">અમારું</span> = nuestro."
